      "value": "Hi! This is a bug report with more than one report. Please remake it into two items.\nHowever, not being able to favorite/unfavorite avatars is a known issue. You can find the main item we're using to track this problem [here](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1048bug-can-not-favorite-or-unfavorite-avatars-or-worlds).\nThe other item, being unable to use seats, may be related to your avatar. It likely isn't a bug! Make sure the avatar you're in has arms (is humanoid) and try again.",
